#  Key Logic I Learned

```text
Iterable
   ↓
iter()
   ↓
Iterator
   ↓
next()
   ↓
Value one at a time
   ↓
No values
   ↓
StopIteration
```

Generator:

```text
Generator Function
       ↓
     yield
       ↓
Produce one value
       ↓
     pause
       ↓
     next()
       ↓
Resume
```

Generator Expression:

```text
(expression for item in iterable)
```

`yield from`:

```text
yield from iterable
        ↓
Yield each value from that iterable
```

##  Important Difference

```text
List        → Stores all values
Iterator    → Produces values one at a time
Generator   → Produces values lazily
yield       → Produces and pauses
next()      → Requests the next value
```
